# Unity Assets & Performance

## Asset Import Settings

### Textures

| Loại | Format | Max Size | Compression | Mip Maps |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| UI Sprites | RGBA32 | 1024 | High | ❌ |
| 3D Textures | RGBA32 | 2048 | Medium | ✅ |
| Icons | RGBA32 | 256 | High | ❌ |

**Naming:** `snake_case` (ui_button_normal, player_idle_01, icon_health)

### Models

| Loại | Polygons | LOD | Collider |
|---|---|---|---|
| Character | 5k-15k | 3 | ✅ |
| Enemy | 2k-8k | 2 | ✅ |
| Props | 100-1k | 1 | ✅ |

**Naming:** `PascalCase` with prefix (char_player_01, env_tree_oak, weapon_sword)

### Audio

| Loại | Format | Quality | Load Type |
|---|---|---|---|
| Music | Vorbis | 70% | Streaming |
| SFX | Vorbis | 50% | Compressed In Memory |
| Voice | Vorbis | 60% | Compressed In Memory |
| UI | Vorbis | 40% | Compressed In Memory |

**Naming:** `snake_case` (music_main_theme, sfx_jump_01, voice_player_hurt)

## Asset Organization

```
_Game/
├─ _2D/              # 2D sprites
├─ _3D/              # 3D models
├─ _Animation/       # Animations
├─ _SFX/             # Audio
├─ _VFX/             # Effects
├─ Materials/        # Materials
├─ Prefabs/          # Prefabs
│  ├─ Characters/
│  ├─ Environment/
│  ├─ UI/
│  └─ Weapons/
├─ SO/               # ScriptableObjects
└─ Textures/         # Textures
```

## Performance Targets

### Frame Rate

| Platform | Target | Min | Budget |
|---|---|---|---|
| PC Mid | 60 FPS | 30 FPS | < 6ms |
| Mobile Mid | 30 FPS | 20 FPS | < 12ms |
| VR | 90 FPS | 72 FPS | < 3ms |

### Draw Calls
- Mobile: < 120 draw calls, < 200 batches
- PC: < 200 draw calls, < 300 batches

### Memory
- GC alloc per frame = 0 trong gameplay
- Dùng object pooling, StringBuilder

## CPU Optimization

**Centralized Tick:**
```csharp
public interface ITickable { void Tick(float dt); }

public class TickManager : MonoBehaviour {
    private List<ITickable> tickables = new List<ITickable>(64);
    
    void Update() {
        float dt = Time.deltaTime;
        for (int i = 0; i < tickables.Count; i++)
            tickables[i].Tick(dt);
    }
    
    public void Add(ITickable t) => tickables.Add(t);
    public void Remove(ITickable t) => tickables.Remove(t);
}
```

**Coroutine với flags:**
```csharp
private bool m_isProcessing;

void Update() {
    if (Input.GetKeyDown(KeyCode.Space) && !m_isProcessing)
        StartCoroutine(Process());
}

IEnumerator Process() {
    m_isProcessing = true;
    yield return new WaitForSeconds(1f);
    // Do work
    m_isProcessing = false;
}
```

